{"title":"2025 IOQM/Problem 18","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span id=\"Problem_Statement_.E0.B4.AA.E0.B5.8D.E0.B4.B0.E0.B4.B6.E0.B5.8D.E0.B4.A8.E0.B4.B5.E0.B4.BF.E0.B4.B5.E0.B4.B0.E0.B4.A3.E0.B4.82\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_Statement_പ്രശ്നവിവരണം\">Problem Statement പ്രശ്നവിവരണം</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_IOQM/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem Statement പ്രശ്നവിവരണം\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/3/9b388fd3ea5c2029ae81ce908df8b3de6fcbc417.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$MTAI$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"58\" height=\"14\" /> is a parallelogram of area <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/b/99b8276b66db60b2cf407f5b08ac17f97cfe06fe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{40}{41}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"24\" height=\"38\" /> square units such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/2/2e266923acaf2018b651dbdcb8834666a5200784.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$MI = \\frac{1}{MT}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"92\" height=\"38\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is the least possible length of the diagonal <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/f/62f7eb82948ac9d7e8659abb37508b1015d8a3cf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$MA$\" width=\"33\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/0/a10a85638630ef790fb9072a9e959c47002ec298.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d^2 = \\frac{a}{b}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"57\" height=\"34\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/4/10407dede61b6c4c4aa9bbc193304c7c8ecf423f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,b \\in \\mathbb{Z}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/6/a964dc4456ed42fcc8c54c7d4054fd8c79ceb890.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\gcd(a,b) = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"102\" height=\"20\" />, find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/1/3311eba472bf7dc846f58d649d3756cf443eb108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|a-b|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"48\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/3/9b388fd3ea5c2029ae81ce908df8b3de6fcbc417.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$MTAI$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"58\" height=\"14\" /> എന്നത് <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/b/99b8276b66db60b2cf407f5b08ac17f97cfe06fe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{40}{41}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"24\" height=\"38\" /> ചതുരശ്ര യൂണിറ്റ് വിസ്തീർണ്ണമുള്ള ഒരു സമാന്തരചതുർഭുജമാണ്. കൂടാതെ <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/2/2e266923acaf2018b651dbdcb8834666a5200784.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$MI = \\frac{1}{MT}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"92\" height=\"38\" /> ആണ്. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/f/62f7eb82948ac9d7e8659abb37508b1015d8a3cf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$MA$\" width=\"33\" height=\"13\" /> എന്ന വികർണ്ണത്തിന്റെ സാധ്യമായ ഏറ്റവും കുറഞ്ഞ നീളം <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> ആണെന്നും, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/2/c321f1a297dfcdcfe2c5cab79e82c5a25db1b54d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d^2 = \\frac{a}{b},$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"62\" height=\"34\" /> ഇവിടെ <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/4/10407dede61b6c4c4aa9bbc193304c7c8ecf423f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,b \\in \\mathbb{Z}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" /> ഉം <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/b/bcb04971aa1521dca22b49b27b1c7c026accd676.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\gcd(a,b)=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"99\" height=\"18\" /> ഉം ആണെങ്കിൽ, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/1/3311eba472bf7dc846f58d649d3756cf443eb108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|a-b|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"48\" height=\"18\" /> കണ്ടെത്തുക.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_.E0.B4.AA.E0.B4.B0.E0.B4.BF.E0.B4.B9.E0.B4.BE.E0.B4.B0.E0.B4.82\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_പരിഹാരം\">Solution പരിഹാരം</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_IOQM/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution പരിഹാരം\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:2025IOQMP18.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/c/c5/2025IOQMP18.png/450px-2025IOQMP18.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"450\" height=\"223\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/c/c5/2025IOQMP18.png/675px-2025IOQMP18.png 1.5x, https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/c/c5/2025IOQMP18.png/900px-2025IOQMP18.png 2x\" /></a></span>\n</p><p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/a/12a6dd1ec5dff0524eef2a0f993031940238243c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$MI = x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"66\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/7/427aae090b1bf3ed048567de08bc903222618d02.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$MT = \\frac{1}{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"73\" height=\"38\" />. Then, if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/e/52e8ed7a3ba22130ad3984eb2cd413406475a689.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\theta$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is the angle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/9/df9b39477dac88bfe9918ee5e10f40ae2c0b880a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle AIM$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"57\" height=\"14\" /> then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/6/b26eb1d1ad87e76f7715a3fa4d53ea1d45abd394.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin(\\theta) = \\frac{40}{41}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"94\" height=\"38\" />. By Pythagorean Identity, this means <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/9/f49b5e1e01de21dcbc6f3c1e86c8cf4c0c43dd55.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos(\\theta) = \\frac{9}{41}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"96\" height=\"38\" />. Neglect the negative as the angle is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/c/1dc884a4b656043277d23913de0c775d085afd72.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$&lt;90^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"47\" height=\"16\" />. By Law of Cosines, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/a/55a8a37f3c166a02ef49f516ed55074ea547e3b6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d^2 = x^2 + \\frac{1}{x^2} - \\frac{18}{41}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"149\" height=\"38\" />. To minimize <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/f/37fbc764994bede9fd6f69a89f5c315850f74fb0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 + \\frac{1}{x^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"64\" height=\"38\" />, we use AM-GM, from which <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/d/64d236ef743a7da9604d6b2961f3a532e76f9f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{LHS} \\geq 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"67\" height=\"16\" />. Then, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/6/896dc895968b8da254f828c3901d2a0259884e8f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d^2 = 2- \\frac{18}{41} = \\frac{82-18}{41} = \\frac{64}{41}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"230\" height=\"38\" />. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/1/131f66e120ee5010f3d02599fc0e81cfe287287f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|a-b| = |64-41| = \\boxed{23}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"198\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/a/12a6dd1ec5dff0524eef2a0f993031940238243c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$MI = x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"66\" height=\"14\" /> എന്നും <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/7/427aae090b1bf3ed048567de08bc903222618d02.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$MT = \\frac{1}{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"73\" height=\"38\" /> എന്നും എടുക്കുക. അപ്പോൾ, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/e/52e8ed7a3ba22130ad3984eb2cd413406475a689.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\theta$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> എന്നത് <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/9/df9b39477dac88bfe9918ee5e10f40ae2c0b880a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle AIM$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"57\" height=\"14\" /> ആണെങ്കിൽ, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/6/cb6ee7dcd70e6eb13e1ca3927dcd4b2e88fe9763.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin(\\theta) = \\frac{40}{41}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"99\" height=\"38\" />. പൈത്തഗോറിയൻ സമവാക്യം ഉപയോഗിക്കുമ്പോൾ, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/4/5a4cbdb9d1d3657026eca5a94cbe7563df4fbbcf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos(\\theta) = \\frac{9}{41}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"101\" height=\"38\" />\nനെഗറ്റീവ് മൂല്യം ഒഴിവാക്കാം, കാരണം കോണം <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/e/22ec0d2e4202839322d26a23dcb13f79821df5d7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$90^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"28\" height=\"15\" />-ൽ കുറവാണ്. കൊസൈൻ നിയമം ഉപയോഗിച്ച്, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/a/50a378f50f56756a28240d0e3dec6240daeb46e0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d^2 = x^2 + \\frac{1}{x^2} - \\frac{18}{41}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"154\" height=\"38\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/f/37fbc764994bede9fd6f69a89f5c315850f74fb0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 + \\frac{1}{x^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"64\" height=\"38\" /> ഏറ്റവും കുറഞ്ഞതാക്കാൻ AM-GM ഉപയോഗിക്കാം. അതിൽ നിന്ന് <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/d/64d236ef743a7da9604d6b2961f3a532e76f9f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{LHS} \\geq 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"67\" height=\"16\" /> ലഭിക്കുന്നു. അതിനാൽ, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/c/2ec797692babed2cc131d7a2569ae04ff62a2634.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d^2 = 2- \\frac{18}{41} = \\frac{82-18}{41} = \\frac{64}{41}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"235\" height=\"38\" /> അതിനാൽ, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/b/c5bb68aa4e54de5f69883e0e40fd267ca5c10b4f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|a-b| = |64-41| = \\boxed{23}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"203\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~Pinotation\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018070530\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.019 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.032 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 167/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 7824/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:37911:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018070530 and revision id 292678. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}